<h1>Your tenancy has been registered</h1>
<p>Dear <%= @tenancy.user.name %>,</p>
<p>Your tenancy has been registered with the following details:</p>
<p>
  <strong>Room:</strong> <%= @tenancy.room.name %><br>
  <strong>Start date:</strong> <%= l(@tenancy.start_date) %><br>
  <strong>End date:</strong> <%= l(@tenancy.end_date) %>
</p>
<p>
  You can see these details at any time by logging in at <%= link_to root_url, root_url %> with <%= @tenancy.user.email_address %>.
  If you can't remember your password, use “Forgot password?” on the login page.
</p>
<p>If you have any questions, please reach out to the hostel management team.</p>
<%= render "signature" %>
